<title>ITALY: Italian parliamentary group to review transport issues.</title>
<headline>Italian parliamentary group to review transport issues.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Italian parliamentary sub-committee said it will hold a hearing into air cargo and inter-modal transport issues on May 20.</p>
<p>The parliament's technological innovation sub-committee(COPIT) said in a statement it will also review dangerous and toxic goods transport as well as intermodal surface transport.</p>
<p>Alitalia cargo executive, Fulvio Neri,will make a presentation to the committee together with Freight Leaders' Club, Giuseppe Pinna who will speak on inter-modal issues. --Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542-7706 Fax+5017</p>
</text>
